1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,861
Two more facts to remember.

2
00:00:01,861 --> 00:00:08,294
In a progressive wave, every particle vibrates with the same amplitude and the same frequency.

3
00:00:08,294 --> 00:00:13,072
But each one starts its vibration slightly later than the one before it.

4
00:00:13,072 --> 00:00:17,122
The phase lags steadily along the direction of travel.

